     "titulo": "Opinion and contrast",
     "texto": [
      "**Κατά τη γνώμη μου** means «in my opinion». To qualify an opinion, use **αν και** («although») or **όμως** («however»). A reason can be introduced with **γιατί**.",
      "First practice with the example; then try to express the same idea with your own information."
     ],
